    <briefdescription>
<para><computeroutput><ref refid="class_mutable_engine_object" kindref="compound">MutableEngineObject</ref></computeroutput> wrapper that owns a <computeroutput><ref refid="class_point_array" kindref="compound">PointArray</ref></computeroutput> via <computeroutput>unique_ptr</computeroutput>. </para>
    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para>Same pattern as <computeroutput><ref refid="class_m2_s_l_program" kindref="compound">M2SLProgram</ref></computeroutput> / <computeroutput><ref refid="class_m2_homotopy" kindref="compound">M2Homotopy</ref></computeroutput>: the interpreter holds an opaque <computeroutput>M2PointArray*</computeroutput> while engine code reaches the underlying clustering structure through <computeroutput><ref refid="class_m2_point_array_a1be9dc5011373d6b2430e96a383dd111_1a1be9dc5011373d6b2430e96a383dd111" kindref="member">value()</ref></computeroutput>. </para>
    </detaileddescription>
